    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Swift removal of packing debris</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">After placement, all crates, foam, bubble wrap and protective films are collected for recycling or disposal. Collected materials are segregated into recyclable, reusable, and waste streams in accordance with local environmental regulations. A dedicated crew sweeps and mops the area, confirming no packaging remains before a final hand‑over sign‑off.</p>
